<%# The Big One — sponsor rate card, in the publication's own face.
    Honest founding copy throughout: audience growing, founding rates,
    NO invented reach numbers. Every inquiry runs through the site's
    existing contact machinery (POST /contact, topic 'other' — the
    pattern the CannaDash partner door uses). %>
<header class="masthead">
  <div class="mast-top">
    <span>VOL. I — NO. 1</span>
    <span class="mast-open">★ FOUNDING RATE CARD ★</span>
    <span>ABBEVILLE, LOUISIANA</span>
  </div>
  <h1 class="mast-name" style="font-size:38px;">Sponsor The Big One</h1>
  <p class="mast-tag">The paper people <b>finish</b> — every edition ends, on purpose.</p>
  <p class="mast-date"><a href="/the-big-one">← Read today's edition</a></p>
</header>

<div class="tbo-doors">
  <p>The Big One is a daily edition with a beginning and an end — no infinite feed, nothing
  infinite to scroll past your name. Readers finish it with their coffee, and the sponsor
  chair sits where finishers land. The audience is <b>growing</b> and these are
  <b>founding rates</b>: locked for founding sponsors while the paper finds its readers.
  We don't print reach numbers we can't prove — when we can prove them, they'll be on this page.</p>

  <section>
    <h3>📋 The Rate Card</h3>
    <% for (const o of offers) { %>
    <article class="tbo-card">
      <h4><%= o.name %></h4>
      <p class="tbo-price"><%= money(o.priceCents) %><span class="tbo-note"> / <%= o.per %></span></p>
      <p><%= o.blurb %></p>
      <% if (o.planSlug) { %>
      <p><a class="tbo-btn gold" href="/the-big-one#subscribe">Buy the Waiting Room plan at the register</a></p>
      <% } %>
    </article>
    <% } %>

    <article class="tbo-card">
      <h4>Classifieds &amp; Notices — the small print that works</h4>
      <% for (const l of listings) { %>
      <p><b><%= l.kind === 'notices' ? 'Notices' : 'Classifieds' %>:</b>
      <span class="tbo-price" style="font-size:18px;"><%= money(l.priceCents) %></span>
      <span class="tbo-note">— one listing, <%= l.days %> days, reviewed by the desk before it runs.</span></p>
      <% } %>
      <p><a class="tbo-btn" href="/the-big-one/classifieds">Place a listing</a></p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h3>✉️ Ask the Desk</h3>
    <div class="tbo-card">
      <p>Every sponsorship starts with a conversation — tell us which chair you're looking at
      and the desk replies from the feedback inbox. Payment is arranged at the register
      (PayPal, like everything in the house) once we've agreed the run.</p>
      <form method="post" action="/contact" class="tbo-form">
        <input type="text" name="website" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true">
        <input type="hidden" name="topic" value="other">
        <label for="spName">Your name / business</label>
        <input id="spName" type="text" name="name" required maxlength="120">
        <label for="spEmail">Email</label>
        <input id="spEmail" type="email" name="email" required maxlength="120">
        <label for="spMsg">Which sponsorship?</label>
        <textarea id="spMsg" name="message" required maxlength="2000" rows="5">The Big One sponsorship inquiry — I'm interested in: </textarea>
        <p><button class="tbo-btn gold" type="submit">Send the inquiry</button></p>
      </form>
    </div>
    <%- include('../partials/ad-slot', {slot: 'home_inline'}) %>
    <div class="tbo-card">
      <h4>☕ Tip the Desk</h4>
      <p><a class="tbo-btn" href="https://www.paypal.com/ncp/payment/WA9DS6J8ERSHW" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Tip via Business PayPal</a></p>
      <p class="tbo-note">From the same house: <a href="/onemind">OneMind</a> · <a href="/">Tattoo Art Customs</a> · <a href="/apps">Every app</a> · <a href="/the-big-one">Today's edition</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
